  "notes": "This repo IS the clodex catalogue: CLODEX_HOME resolves here via the ~/.claude/skills/clodex symlink, so runs in this repo self-host the engine. Worktree lanes are driven by the MAIN checkout's engine (through the symlink); in-flight edits to state/ or runner/ inside a lane never destabilize the run driving them. release_owner is external because releases here are Johnny's hand ritual (tag + push from the main checkout); lane runs end handed-off with a reviewed branch. Profile interviewed and ratified by Johnny 2026-09-01 (lane-A bootstrap). AMENDED 2026-09-01 (Johnny-approved, lane-A run r-2026-09-01-a): version.source set to null so skills/clodex/VERSION is NOT release-owned — it is the skill-version file that runs themselves own and bump per bump_rule (minor for behavior, patch for docs/fixes); tags follow it by hand at Johnny's release ritual (release_owner external, so ship's version machinery never runs here).",
